  "body": "Fixes #7557 (queue task 14420).\n\n`protect_newline_destinations` tracked an open inline code span that only an equal-length backtick run closed, carried across blank lines and every other block boundary to end of document. One stray/unmatched backtick in prose therefore disabled newline-destination protection for the rest of the document — the load/save link corruption the protection exists to prevent.\n\nFix (CommonMark oracle: an unmatched backtick run is literal text):\n- A backtick run now opens a span only when an equal-length run closes it within the same paragraph (`code_span_closes_within_paragraph` lookahead); paragraph end = blank line (whitespace-only lines count) or EOF.\n- Span state is also reset at a blank line in the line-start classification, so no residual state can cross a paragraph break.\n\nVerification (on the laptop, `pkgs/id`):\n- `cargo test --features web test_newline_destination` — 2 passed: new `test_newline_destination_protection_unmatched_backtick` (stray single/double run, same-paragraph and later-paragraph destinations protected; closed span after a stray stays literal) and the pre-existing #1707 `test_newline_destination_protection_skips_literal_contexts`.\n- `cargo test --features web web::markdown` — 267 passed, 0 failed.\n- `rustfmt --check` on the touched file: clean.\n- Note: the web-feature build needs the gitignored `web/dist` embed folder; a local placeholder was used for the test build only and is not part of this change (diff is the single markdown.rs file).\n\n<!-- codesmith:footer -->\n---\n<a href=\"https://backend.blacksmith.sh/track/enable-autofix?expires=1796843076&installation_model_id=443529&pr_number=8061&ref=codesmith_pr_footer&repository=developing-today%2Fcode&return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fdeveloping-today%2Fcode%2Fpull%2F8061&signature=536cd6c8190e844ddf6dd57bda34d4915f7c56fd17adcae3e6e89d590e88b87a\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-light.svg\"><img alt=\"Autofix with [code]smith\" src=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark-3x.png\" width=\"190\" height=\"28\"></picture></a>\n<sup><a href=\"https://app.blacksmith.sh/developing-today/codesmith/code/pr/8061?autoLogin=true&ref=codesmith_pr_footer\">Open in [code]smith</a> · Need help on this PR? Tag <code>@codesmith-bot</code> with what you need.</sup>\n\n<!-- codesmith:autofix:disabled -->\n<!-- /codesmith:footer -->",
